OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son shortlisted for
OL,4,AWaterstones award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father and son have been shortlisted
OL,7,Ffor Waterstones Book of the Year after
OL,8,Fturning an arts and crafts evening at
OL,9,Fhome into a children's picture book.
OL,11,FDan Ojari and his eight-year-old son
OL,12,FFinn, from Bristol, coined the idea for
OL,13,FIs This a Plum? after noticing
OL,14,Fpotential in the shapes left behind
OL,15,Fafter cutting out paper.
OL,17,FDan said he hoped it would inspire
OL,18,Fcreativity in the next generation,
OL,19,Fadding: "Now, more than ever, we need
OL,20,Fchildren to spread their unique
OL,21,Fsilliness and simple wisdom."
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
