OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son shortlisted for
OL,4,AWaterstones award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe playful rhyming book featuring
OL,7,Finteractive cut-outs is among 20
OL,8,Frecommended books on the shortlist. The
OL,9,Fwinner will be announced on 26
OL,10,FNovember.
